		{"id":"ee1394abfcf1ce8a","type":"text","text":"ISO GQL","x":493,"y":2140,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"867436da8c075763","type":"text","text":"```\nGraphQuery {\n  match:  Pattern                       // node, then (step, node)*\n  where:  Predicate?\n  return: Projection | Aggregate        // count in the base, group-by later\n  order:  [Sort]\n  page:   { limit, cursor? }\n  time:   { asOf: LogPosition = latest, validAt?: Time }\n}\n\nNode      { var, kinds?: [Kind], source?: Search }\nStep      { relations?: [RelationType], direction: out | in | both,\n            hops: 1 | {min, max}, var? }\nSearch    { query: Text | Vector | Example(EntityRef),\n            mode: exact | keyword | fuzzy | semantic, k? }\nPredicate = Compare(attr, op, value) | In(ids) | Matches(attr, text)\n          | And | Or | Not | Exists(Pattern)\n```\n\n```\ninterface DataStore {\n  capabilities(): Capabilities            // what it can execute\n  negotiate(fragment): Pushdown           // per operator: exact | inexact | unsupported\n  execute(fragment, ctx): Stream<Batch>, ResultMeta\n  changes?(since: LogPosition): Stream<Change>    // capability\n}\n\nctx        = { principal, scopes, snapshot: LogPosition, deadline }\nResultMeta = { completeness: complete | partial(reason) | unknown,\n               nextCursor?, appliedPosition }\n\n// base fragment: everything in the base list from before\nScan { table: EntityTable(kind) | RelationTable(type),\n       projection, filters, sort?, limit?, cursor?, countOnly? }\n\n// capability fragments\nTraverse | Search(mode) | GroupAggregate | Spatial | Window | ...\n```","x":778,"y":1980,"width":780,"height":940},
		{"id":"ec46c3df643531e6","type":"text","text":"mixins to caps","x":493,"y":2240,"width":250,"height":60},
